00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:11.080
Greg said, yes, it was originally a pitch for Pam when she was in New York going to art school.

295
00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:16.400
The idea was that she was on the subway and she was getting hassled by someone, and the

296
00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.960
