00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:32.940
The idea was that we wanted to make people worry that she was maybe drifting apart from

300
00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:34.260
Jim while she was in New York.

301
00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.700
Greg said it was pretty much the story role that Rich Sommer ended up playing.

302
00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:43.840
And he said he loved this idea, and everyone in the writer's room loved this idea, but

303
00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.180
they felt like it was something we should save for later, kind of like what you were saying,

304
00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:47.580
Angela.

305
00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:53.080
He said it kind of made you think about the documentary crew too much for like a season

306
00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:53.960
three moment.

