00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:59.700
He said it would be hard to put that back in the bottle for the rest of the season.

310
00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:02.160
Yeah, because you're like, what, is the guy standing there?

311
00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.520
Yes, you'd be thinking about them too much.

312
00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:09.420
But Greg said he always thought it was a really creative pitch, and he said, but considering

313
00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:14.040
it was season nine, and he was aiming at the documentary airing at the end of season

314
00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.120
nine, he said, we wouldn't need to put anything back in the bottle.

