1099
00:46:09.230 --> 00:46:14.650
By writing my name in the column below, I do hereby resolve to swear an oath of loyalty

1100
00:46:14.650 --> 00:46:19.690
and obedience to Dunder Mifflin and its affiliates, hereinafter, company.

1101
00:46:19.990 --> 00:46:27.450
For life plus 10 years, my loyalty and priorities will be wholly with company and no side projects

1102
00:46:27.450 --> 00:46:30.050
or extracurricular endeavors, a.k.a.

1103
00:46:30.470 --> 00:46:33.250
moonlighting at dumb-sounding companies, including but not

1104
00:46:33.250 --> 00:46:34.330
limited to athlete.

1105
00:46:36.070 --> 00:46:43.030
I also promise not to take tips or kickbacks or any form of payola, as such term is generally

1106
00:46:43.030 --> 00:46:47.970
defined in the radio industry, in exchange for giving special treatment to any customers,

1107
00:46:48.330 --> 00:46:49.910
