And he turns to Mr. Romenko and says, I hope you have nothing planned for the whole afternoon.

1193
00:51:13.650 --> 00:51:17.030
And Mr. Romenko says, actually, I do have.

1194
00:51:17.150 --> 00:51:21.670
And Dwight pushes Romenko into the conference room and then shouts to everyone,

1195
00:51:21.890 --> 00:51:23.770
irate customer coming through.

1196
00:51:24.550 --> 00:51:24.850
Yes.

1197
