1217
00:52:28.910 --> 00:52:30.530
Creed and Creed's lying.

1218
00:52:30.730 --> 00:52:31.370
He's so funny.

1219
00:52:31.490 --> 00:52:33.390
He's like, yeah, I'll play that out.

1220
00:52:33.870 --> 00:52:36.810
He's like, sure, yeah, let's see what, let's play that out.

1221
00:52:37.010 --> 00:52:42.290
And imagine during all of this, poor Mr. Romenko is just like, can I go?

1222
00:52:42.990 --> 00:52:46.310
And this conference room scene was so fun to shoot.

1223
00:52:46.530 --> 00:52:49.030
We broke and laughed several times,

1224
00:52:49.030 --> 00:52:53.070
