1225
00:52:53.270 --> 00:52:53.950
I want to play it.

1226
00:52:54.430 --> 00:52:57.350
Well, I think it would be immoral for Aaron to cheat on Andy.

1227
00:52:57.550 --> 00:52:58.090
Oh, I'm sorry.

1228
00:52:58.410 --> 00:52:59.530
Didn't you cheat on Andy?

1229
