Yes, and he didn't like it.

1230
00:53:04.280 --> 00:53:05.000
That too.

1231
00:53:05.200 --> 00:53:08.340
I love when you said yes, and he didn't like it very much.

1232
00:53:08.440 --> 00:53:10.600
Yes, and I'm really put out, and he didn't like it.

1233
00:53:11.580 --> 00:53:14.600
One of our favorite things as a cast, we've talked about this before,

1234
00:53:14.840 --> 00:53:18.140
