1235
00:53:18.360 --> 00:53:20.280
And this was one of those scenes.

1236
00:53:20.560 --> 00:53:23.920
Everyone in the conference room had something hilarious that they contributed.

1237
00:53:23.920 --> 00:53:27.980
Yes, and by the way, Mr. Romenko was great.

1238
00:53:28.400 --> 00:53:32.220
Yes, guest star, shout out to Mr. Romenko, played by Bob Bluberman.

1239
00:53:32.360 --> 00:53:36.740
He was originally a lawyer who left law to become an actor in 1995.

1240
00:53:37.300 --> 00:53:39.880
Well, Bob has crossover connections with both you and I.

