1248
00:54:01.360 --> 00:54:01.840
Bob.

1249
00:54:01.980 --> 00:54:02.860
Hook us up.

1250
00:54:02.980 --> 00:54:03.260
Yeah.

1251
00:54:03.520 --> 00:54:04.560
We have so many voices.

1252
00:54:04.920 --> 00:54:06.100
