And she's kind of like crawling on the floor.

1352
00:58:28.120 --> 00:58:29.420
Like she's kind of being annoying.

1353
00:58:29.420 --> 00:58:29.940
All that.

1354
00:58:30.340 --> 00:58:34.040
So by the time she gets the phone call, people have had it with her.

1355
00:58:34.280 --> 00:58:34.580
Yes.

1356
00:58:34.960 --> 00:58:37.540
Well, special guest star alert.

1357
00:58:37.540 --> 00:58:41.160
The angry, shushing mom and dad were played by people we know.

