00:59:02.420 --> 00:59:07.260
Also, Brian Whittle appears three times in the credits of that episode.

1363
00:59:07.700 --> 00:59:09.660
Brian's playing the man at the recital.

1364
00:59:10.000 --> 00:59:14.480
Brian Whittle is also the actual boom operator credited for the show.

1365
00:59:14.480 --> 00:59:21.140
And then Chris Diamantopoulos played Brian Whittle, the boom operator character who breaks the wall.

1366
00:59:21.420 --> 00:59:22.740
So there's trivia.

1367
00:59:24.120 --> 00:59:26.960
Brian Whittle, you're all over the place in this episode.

1368
00:59:27.300 --> 00:59:27.380
I know.

1369
00:59:27.760 --> 00:59:31.740
I do love that the character of the boom operator's name is Brian Whittle.

1370
00:59:32.320 --> 00:59:33.740
First and last name.

1371
00:59:33.840 --> 00:59:34.200
I know.

1372
00:59:34.220 --> 00:59:35.120
Of the real guy.

1373
00:59:35.380 --> 00:59:37.980
Of one of the real boom operators for the show.

1374
00:59:37.980 --> 00:59:41.000
You know, this brings me to a fan question from Lindsay A.

1375
00:59:41.080 --> 00:59:43.180
