Basically, he just puts on a tripod because we don't have a person to hold it, so we capture other sound.

1389
01:00:33.040 --> 01:00:37.000
Yeah, you get the atmosphere of the room on the boom mic as well.

1390
01:00:37.260 --> 01:00:37.520
Yeah.

1391
01:00:37.820 --> 01:00:42.580
And a lot of times, for the most part on our show, it was the boom sound that you heard.

1392
01:00:42.760 --> 01:00:43.940
The lav mics were backup.

1393
01:00:44.360 --> 01:00:44.560
Yeah.

1394
01:00:45.040 --> 01:00:46.620
But it's a really good question.

1395
01:00:46.640 --> 01:00:47.340
